{"title": "Status properties/IsInvulnerableVisible", "pageid": 35337, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/IsInvulnerableVisible", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>IsInvulnerableVisible</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_IsInvulnerableVisible\">List of conditions with IsInvulnerableVisible</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Eternally_Bound\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eternally_Bound_(Condition)\" title=\"Eternally Bound (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eternally Bound\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Eternally_Bound_(Condition)\" title=\"Eternally Bound (Condition)\">Eternally Bound</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cazador will not let this spawn die - it is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Globe_of_Invulnerability)_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Globe of Invulnerability) (Condition)\">Invulnerable</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</li>\n<li>Grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on all <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Invulnerable\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class